{"kind":"artifact","text":"The gs serve reference page at docs/reference/gs/serve.md on repair head b966b0f4. It enumerates --otel-endpoint and --profile-listen, which the CLI surface gate requires and the reviewed head omitted, and states what they mean: off is absent rather than quiet, so with no endpoint nothing is measured and no exporter starts; HTTP labels carry the registered route template and never the request path; Go runtime metrics are included; and the profiler binds its own checked loopback address, with the warning that whoever can reach that port can read a memory profile.","body":{"commit":"b966b0f499aace6120f9c2ff01ab48211e59d489","path":"docs/reference/gs/serve.md"}}